DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ccaass driver provides support for various NICs based on the Sun
     Cassini/Cassini+ and National Semiconductor Saturn Ethernet controller
     chips, including the following:

           ••   Sun GigaSwift Ethernet Adapter (10/100/1000baseT)
           ••   Sun GigaSwift Ethernet MMF Adapter (1000baseSX)
           ••   Sun Quad GigaSwift Ethernet UTP Adapter (10/100/1000baseT)
           ••   Sun Quad GigaSwift PCI-X Adapter (10/100/1000baseT)
           ••   Sun Dual Gigabit Ethernet and Dual SCSI/P Adapter
               (10/100/1000baseT)

     It uses an internal or external PHY or an external 10-bit interface.

     The ccaass driver supports several media types, which are selected via the
     ifconfig(8) command.  The supported media types are:

           mmeeddiiaa autoselect
                  Attempt to autoselect the media type (default)

           mmeeddiiaa 1000baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                  Use 1000baseT on copper, full duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 1000baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt half-duplex
                  Use 1000baseT on copper, half duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 1000baseSX mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                  Use 1000baseSX on fiber, full duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 1000baseSX mmeeddiiaaoopptt half-duplex
                  Use 1000baseSX on fiber, half duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 100baseTX mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                  Use 100baseTX, full duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 100baseTX mmeeddiiaaoopptt half-duplex
                  Use 100baseTX, half duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 10baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                  Use 10baseT, full duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 10baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt half-duplex
                  Use 10baseT, half duplex

